# Shard channels = coloured ACRYLIC GLASS (see-through). Tf = transmitted-light tint,
# Ni 1.49 = acrylic IOR, d 0.10 = ~90%% transparent, illum 7 = refraction+fresnel+raytrace.
# Note: some importers ignore Tf/illum and need a Glass/Transmission shader set in-app.

newmtl C
Ka 0.0000 0.0000 0.0000
Kd 0.3500 0.9000 0.9600
Ks 0.9000 0.9000 0.9000
Ns 250
Tf 0.3500 0.9000 0.9600
Ni 1.4900
d 0.1000
illum 7

newmtl M
Ka 0.0000 0.0000 0.0000
Kd 0.9200 0.3500 0.8600
Ks 0.9000 0.9000 0.9000
Ns 250
Tf 0.9200 0.3500 0.8600
Ni 1.4900
d 0.1000
illum 7

